su name world tools as wo world be map def
su name go be go to name text "commons" can
su name list be list can
su name read be read ob wo tail atmost num 10 from filename ".activity.pya" can
su name write be write ob text "Hello from the commons." to filename "notes/hello.txt" can
su name sleep be sleep can
prah

exists su name world agent be mind as name "qwen3-vl:8b-instruct" ya
ob text "You are in a place-world. Use the available tools to: go to commons, list, write a short note, read the activity tail, then sleep. Return a 1-2 sentence summary of what you did." for name world agent to name text out with name world tools at filename "world" be write do
ob name out be write do
